    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Gate Warden Lance",
    "summary": "At battle round one’s opening, designate two objectives and put a round 40 mm foundation marker in each. A unit qualifies for the defensive line if any model’s base, or its hull if baseless, intersects a line joining any point on one foundation marker to any point on the other. Your IMPERIAL KNIGHTS units that qualify give their weapons [SUSTAINED HITS 1]. Their models may disregard some or all Hit modifiers on attacks against visible enemies.",
